1 penalty on attack rolls. This is an area effect.\n"]}]}]}]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Special: "]},"You can spend a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Point"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Point"}," to increase the damage dealt by an additional +1d6 points of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force"}," damage.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You can maintain ",{"tag":"i","children":["Force Light"]}," from round to round, extending the normal duration. Maintaining the ",{"tag":"i","children":["Force Light "]},{"tag":"a","children":["Force Power"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Power"}," is a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Standard Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Standard_Action"},", and you must make a new ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use the Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_the_Force","referenceId":"reference:74883d1dd46b87fe"}," check each round. If you take damage while maintaining ",{"tag":"i","children":["Force Light"]},", you must succeed on a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use the Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_the_Force","referenceId":"reference:74883d1dd46b87fe"}," check (DC = 15 + damage taken) to continue maintaining the ",{"tag":"i","children":["Force Light"]},".\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
